flowchart TD
  cli([CLI: rag-ingest / ingest.main]) --> settings[Load settings\n.env + environment variables]
  settings --> key{GOOGLE_API_KEY set?}
  key -->|no| errKey([Exit 2: missing key])
  key -->|yes| corpus[Load corpus from CORPUS_DIR\ndocs/corpus: 3 supported files\nextract, normalize, SHA-256 hash]
  corpus --> existing{INDEX_PATH exists?}
  existing -->|yes| loadIdx[Load existing SearchIndex\nif valid JSON/schema]
  existing -->|no / invalid| noReuse[No reusable index]
  loadIdx --> perDoc[For each document]
  noReuse --> perDoc
  perDoc --> reuseCheck{Settings compatible and\ncontent hash unchanged?}
  reuseCheck -->|yes| reuse[Reuse stored chunks + vectors]
  reuseCheck -->|no| chunk[Chunk document\nheading-aware sections, overlap,\nprovenance offsets/page/heading]
  chunk --> embed[Embed chunk texts\nGemini Embedding API\ngemini-embedding-001]
  embed --> storeDoc[Store document chunks + vectors]
  reuse --> storeDoc
  storeDoc --> assemble[Assemble SearchIndex\nmanifest + per-document chunks]
  assemble --> save[Atomic write JSON to INDEX_PATH\ndata/index.json]
  save --> stats([Print build stats to stdout])
